[ti:Underdog]
[ar:Eve]
[by:Boof2015]
[lang:ja]
[langs:ja,en]
[length:3:13]

[00:11.97] 虚実皮膜の狭間で三千世
[>en]Across three thousand worlds, in the thin veil between truth and fiction
[00:14.77] 君の目に映るものは真実か
[>en]Is what appears before your eyes really the truth?
[00:17.72] 人のネガにあてられ伝染した
[>en]Exposed to everyone else's negativity, I caught it too
[00:20.71] 怠惰であることには無問題
[>en]There's nothing wrong with being lazy
[00:23.66] いつだって映えと虚構で成っていた
[>en]It was always built from appearances and make-believe
[00:26.54] 最初は無垢に透き通っていた
[>en]At first, it was innocent and crystal clear
[00:29.48] 今じゃ満たされるものがなんなのか
[>en]Now I don't even know what could satisfy me
[00:32.45] もう現世じゃ無理と諦めて笑っていた た た た
[>en]I'd given up, laughing that this life could never be enough—ha, ha, ha, ha
[00:37.29] もしも君に会えるなら
[>en]If I could see you again
[00:40.63] 呼ぶ声がした
[>en]I heard a voice calling
[00:42.09] 再前世でなくても
[>en]Even if we weren't bound by some former life
[00:44.33] 今をただ 聞かせて見させて
[>en]Just let me hear the present—let me see it
[00:50.08] くだらないと忌み嫌っていた
[>en]I despised it all as meaningless
[00:52.86] 独りで生きてくよ さらば
[>en]I'll live on alone—farewell
[00:55.84] 馬鹿みたいに夜を追っていた
[>en]Like a fool, I kept chasing the night
[00:58.77] ふと気づいてしまう 満たされることのない
[>en]Then suddenly I realized I would never be fulfilled
[01:02.67] 誰よりも困難だって yeah
[>en]Even if it's harder than anyone could know, yeah
[01:05.56] 届かない声を絞って
[>en]Squeeze out the voice that cannot reach
[01:07.96] 叫んでくれよ
[>en]Just scream for me
[01:10.16] 負け犬らしくなっていいから
[>en]It's okay to look like the underdog
[01:15.05] いたって超えられないんで
[>en]Because I simply can't overcome it
[01:16.87] 性根腐りだして
[>en]My very nature begins to rot
[01:18.53] 足元にも及ばないで ないで
[>en]I couldn't even come close, not even close
[01:20.50] 思い出して
[>en]Remember
[01:21.43] また正夢って
[>en]Calling it another dream come true
[01:22.66] さあね さあね
[>en]Who knows, who knows
[01:23.44] 不甲斐ないね
[>en]How pathetic
[01:24.38] 君の言葉はキャラメル味でした
[>en]Your words tasted like caramel
[01:28.14] ふわっと息絶えないで
[>en]Don't just softly fade away
[01:31.03] 期待だけ上がらないで
[>en]Don't let my expectations alone keep rising
[01:34.15] どうしたってつまんないね
[>en]No matter what, it's still so boring
[01:36.91] 居場所などもうない
[>en]There's nowhere left for me
[01:38.78] 沈めた顔は腫れていた
[>en]My downcast face was swollen
[01:42.17] 醜い心のようだった
[>en]It looked just like my ugly heart
[01:45.22] 手を伸ばすこと あの頃は不器用だった
[>en]Back then, I was clumsy even at reaching out
[01:50.44] もしも君に会えるなら
[>en]If I could see you again
[01:53.82] 謝りたいよ もう戻れやしないから
[>en]I want to apologize, because there's no going back now
[01:57.52] 今をただ 聞かせて見させて
[>en]Just let me hear the present—let me see it
[02:02.35]

[02:33.89] くだらないと忌み嫌っていた
[>en]I despised it all as meaningless
[02:36.72] 独りで生きてくよ さらば
[>en]I'll live on alone—farewell
[02:39.74] 馬鹿みたいに夜を追っていた
[>en]Like a fool, I kept chasing the night
[02:42.68] ふと見上げたら 美しい世界だ
[>en]Then I looked up and saw a beautiful world
[02:46.36] 泣いていた時間が力になり
[>en]All the time I spent crying became my strength
[02:49.43] 最低なくだらない愛を唄う
[>en]I sing of the worst, most ridiculous love
[02:52.13] 不安定で痛いな
[>en]It's unsteady, and it hurts
[02:54.19] それも全部愛してしまえる今日になる
[>en]Today will become a day when I can love all of that too
[02:59.40] だから覚えていて
[>en]So remember
[03:01.80] 忘れたって思い出して
[>en]Even if you forget, remember again
[03:04.73] その為に生きていて
[>en]Keep living for that
[03:07.77] 声が出せなくたって
[>en]Even if you can't make a sound
[03:09.87]
